      "remediation": {
        "description": "IAM role has both data access and IAM management permissions. A compromised role can escalate its own privileges.",
        "action": "Split into two roles: one for data access (application role) and one for IAM management (admin role). Use separate assume-role policies for each. Apply the principle of least privilege — data-path roles should never modify IAM.",
